{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Good morning, my dear! I was just thinking last evening, while I was waiting for my bowl of soup, whether I should start writing to you yet — it was 10 o’clock — as whom? — Mr. Heinrich Beer!) — and his wife — entered my room. You can imagine the joy we felt at this so unexpected meeting; since he is going directly back from here, he can tell you that he found me in good health."}}],"created":1795220920,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":94,"prompt_tokens":167,"total_tokens":261,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-xPd97LE9jn8zDvYggeHMPzl932up889E","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":167,"prompt_ms":402.268,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.4087904191616767,"prompt_per_second":415.14612149114527,"predicted_n":94,"predicted_ms":2146.756,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.083397849462365,"predicted_per_second":43.32117855965}}